~ teto
if get_fact("teto.evicted")
	=> teto_evicted
if not get_fact("teto.met")
	=> teto_intake
=> teto_hub


~ teto_intake
$> set_fact("teto.met")
% Teto: [speed=0.3]...[/speed][wait=0.8] You around to the back. [wait=0.6] I heard your FEET on the GROUND the whole way. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_3dab5c]
% Teto: Oh. [wait=0.8] You came round the left side. [wait=0.5] Last time you came round right. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_1a9395]
% Teto: [speed=0.4]SHHHHhh.[/speed] [wait=0.6] She just fell asleep. [wait=0.4] Do not make me start over. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_64cc20]
Teto: [font_size=22][b][rainbow freq=1 sat=1][wave amp=30 freq=6]FORM 31-B[/wave][/rainbow][/b][/font_size] [color=#777]// witness intake // copy 4 of 4 // copies 1 to 3 are filled in, in your handwriting // HELP HELP HELP HELP HELP HELP HELP HELP[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_48e6bd]
Teto: I ask and you will answer. [wait=0.6] [color=#a33]I have the answer sheet right here, so do not bother lying.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_636804]
## Wrong answers cost sanity. TETO keeps count.
Teto: [b]Question one.[/b] [wait=0.5] What did you see? [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_c8226a]
- Nothing. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_0dc2db]
	$> set_fact("teto.witness", "nothing")
	$> add_opinion("teto", 1)
	Teto: [rainbow freq=0.8 sat=0.9][wave amp=20 freq=5]Good![/wave][/rainbow] [wait=0.6] Say it again tonight before you sleep, and again in the morning. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_c86399]
- A woman with drills for hair and a very large bag. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_cb7964]
	$> set_fact("teto.witness", "bag")
	Teto: [speed=0.5]Drills and a bag.[/speed] [wait=0.8] I am writing down how tall you said she was. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]You did not say. I am writing it down anyway.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_51cc09]
- Teto kidnapping Miku. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_c04ca5]
	$> set_fact("teto.witness", "kidnapping")
	=>< teto_wrong
	Teto: [speed=0.4]Look at the wall instead.[/speed] [wait=0.8] Grey, with a crack near the top. [wait=0.6] [font_size=12][color=#777]describe the wall to me until you believe it[/color][/font_size] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_04c4d7]
Teto: [b]Question two.[/b] [wait=0.8] The bag. [wait=0.8] Is it moving? [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_e37168]
- No. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_d6007c]
	$> set_fact("teto.bag_moving", false)
	$> add_opinion("teto", 1)
	Teto: [rainbow freq=0.8 sat=0.9][wave amp=20 freq=5]NO![/wave][/rainbow] [wait=0.6] why are you still looking at it?! [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_698705]
- Its breathing. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_c2b6f9]
	$> set_fact("teto.bag_moving", true)
	=>< teto_wrong
	Teto: [speed=0.5]Thats you.[/speed] [wait=0.8] Hold your breath. [wait=1.2] [shake rate=6 level=3]See?[/shake] [wait=0.4] It stopped. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_c4d8ad]
- Can I see inside? [if get_sanity_zone() < 2 /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_7ce483]
	$> set_fact("teto.bag_moving", "asked")
	$> add_sanity(-10)
	## Only asked at low sanity. caost 10 sanity.
	Teto: [#sanity_glitch] You already did. [wait=0.6] Twice. You keep forgetting so you can ask again. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_47c3ed]
	Teto: [#sanity_glitch] Last time you cried. [wait=0.6] The time before, you climbed in. Before that, dropped down. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_0ded0d]
Teto: [b]Question three.[/b] [rainbow sat=1]The bonus round![/rainbow] [wait=0.8] [color=#777]After this one you can go home. Do you remember which way home is?[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_1ac1ad]
=> teto_exam


~ teto_hub
if get_opinion("teto") <= -3
	Teto: [color=#a33]You.[/color] [wait=0.8] I made room for you in the bag. [wait=0.6] I measured you while you slept, so it should fit. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_74fc73]
elif get_opinion("teto") < 0
	% Teto: [speed=0.5]Oh.[/speed] [wait=0.8] You came back. [wait=0.5] I did not leave the light on for you. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_eb31d3]
	% Teto: Further away. [wait=0.8] Further than that. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]You are not moving. Why are you not moving.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_82c3c4]
elif get_opinion("teto") == 0
	% Teto: Witness. [wait=0.6] Still seeing nothing? [wait=0.6] Good. Keep your eyes on the wall. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_5b8984]
	% Teto: The bag asked about you. [wait=1.0] [color=#777]It wanted to know if you still sleep on your left side.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_5d4046]
else
	% Teto: There you are. [wait=0.6] I counted your steps around the box. [wait=0.4] Forty-one. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]It was forty-one last time too.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_4781c7]
	% Teto: [rainbow sat=1][wave amp=25 freq=6]Hi! Hi![/wave][/rainbow] [wait=1.2] [color=#777]You did not say hi back.[/color] [wait=0.8] The others stopped coming round the back. [wait=0.6] You will keep coming. Right? [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_0deefd]
if get_favor("teto") + get_debt("teto") > 0
	Teto: [font_size=12][color=#777]LEDGER // she owes you {{get_favor("teto")}} // you owe her {{get_debt("teto")}} // signed in your handwriting // you do not remember signing[/color][/font_size] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_e1f009]
=> teto_menu


~ teto_menu
- What is in the bag? [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_120405]
	=> teto_bag
- Spend a favor. Bread. [if get_favor("teto") >= 1 /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_229bc6]
	if give_item("bread")
		$> add_favor("teto", -1)
		Teto: [color=#ffd94a][wave amp=15 freq=4]Fresh bread![/wave][/color] [wait=0.8] It is warm. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]Do not ask why it is warm.[/color] I owe you {{get_favor("teto")}}. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_1d16b0]
	else
		## Make room first.
		Teto: Your hands are full. [wait=0.6] Put something down. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]I will look after it, with the other things people put down back here.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_f39e6e]
	=> teto_menu
- Borrow bread. [if get_debt("teto") < 3 /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_35a688]
	if give_item("bread")
		$> add_debt("teto", 1)
		## Debt to Teto. TETO does not collect. TETO just knows.
		Teto: Take it. [wait=0.6] You owe me {{get_debt("teto")}}. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]I will not ask for it back. I will be around, behind things, until you remember.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_f9350e]
	else
		Teto: You cannot carry more. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]I can see it on your shoulders.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_da43d2]
	=> teto_menu
- Pay her back with bread. [if get_debt("teto") >= 1 and has_item("bread") /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_ae8867]
	$> remove_item("bread")
	$> add_debt("teto", -1)
	$> add_opinion("teto", 1)
	Teto: [speed=0.5]Returned.[/speed] [wait=0.6] It is still warm from your pocket. [wait=0.8] I will keep it next to her so she knows you were here. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_e13ac4]
	=> teto_menu
- Retake the exam. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_136e11]
	=> teto_exam
- Say her name. [if get_opinion("teto") >= 3 /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_849cbb]
	=> teto_name
- [[Miku?|Hatsune Miku?|Miku, are you in there?]] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_e2362f]
	$> set_fact("teto.said_miku")
	=>< teto_wrong
	Teto: [speed=0.4]There is nobody in the bag[/speed] [wait=1.0] who answers to that anymore. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_a3f782]
	=> teto_menu
- Leave. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_ff7f86]
	% Teto: Walk normally. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]People can tell from how you walk when you have seen something.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_7b6d27]
	% Teto: [rainbow sat=1][wave amp=20 freq=5]Bye bye![/wave][/rainbow] [wait=0.8] Do not look back. [wait=1.5] [shake rate=8 level=3]You looked back.[/shake] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_a17f57]
	% Teto: See you soon. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]I will be the one by your door.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_dcbd51]
	=> END


~ teto_bag
match get_fact("teto.bag_lore", 0)
	when 0
		$> set_fact("teto.bag_lore", 1)
		Teto: [color=#ff8fd0][wave amp=15 freq=4]Bread![/wave][/color] [wait=0.6] Long bread. [wait=0.6] Shaped like a person, because I am very good at what I do. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]Do not count the fingers.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_8665eb]
	when 1
		$> set_fact("teto.bag_lore", 2)
		Teto: It is [b]storage[/b]. [wait=0.6] I keep the bag cold, like you would with milk. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_cdec1e]
		Teto: [color=#777]She stopped kicking at 3 am. [wait=0.6] That means she is resting.[/color] [wait=0.8] [rainbow sat=1][wave amp=20 freq=5]She is resting![/wave][/rainbow] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_0b5707]
	when 2
		$> set_fact("teto.bag_lore", 3)
		$> add_sanity(-5)
		## Costs 5 sanity.
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] She got a whole season. [wait=0.6] A year where people said her name and meant it. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_6798b5]
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] I was a joke. [wait=0.6] April 1st. [wait=0.6] I was supposed to stop on April 2nd. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_730331]
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] [speed=0.3]Nobody came to turn me off.[/speed] [wait=1.0] So I kept her, to see how it is done. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_e84330]
	else
		Teto: [speed=0.5]Stop asking.[/speed] [wait=0.8] The bag gets heavier each time you do. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]Have you weighed yourself lately?[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_6670ee]
=> teto_menu


~ teto_exam
## Random question. Right answers raise opp, wrong ones cost sanity.
% => teto_q_age
% => teto_q_birthday
% => teto_q_food
% => teto_q_hair
% => teto_q_species


~ teto_q_age
Teto: [b]How old am I?[/b] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_480eea]
- 31. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_60e159]
	$> set_fact("teto.last_exam", "pass")
	Teto: [rainbow freq=0.8 sat=0.9][wave amp=20 freq=5]Thirty-one![/wave][/rainbow] [wait=0.6] I have been thirty-one for a very long time. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]I check every morning.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_7edd31]
- Like 15? [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_539afa]
	$> set_fact("teto.last_exam", "fail")
	=>< teto_wrong
	Teto: [speed=0.5]Look at me.[/speed] [wait=1.0] Closer. [wait=1.0] [color=#777]Does this face look like it has been young for a while?[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_9fe72a]
- Old enough to know better. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_da5ce6]
	$> set_fact("teto.last_exam", "pass")
	$> add_opinion("teto", 1)
	Teto: [wave amp=5 freq=1]Yes.[/wave] [wait=0.6] [color=#777]And I did it anyway, same as you are about to.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_f0d46e]
=> teto_grade


~ teto_q_birthday
Teto: [b]When is my birthday?[/b] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_daf4d3]
- April 1st. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_4dc62b]
	$> set_fact("teto.last_exam", "pass")
	Teto: [rainbow freq=0.8 sat=0.9][wave amp=20 freq=5]Correct![/wave][/rainbow] [wait=0.6] Everybody laughed. [wait=0.8] I laughed too, so they would not see my face. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_79330a]
	Teto: [color=#777]I am still laughing. Put your ear against the box and you can hear it.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_e4e3b7]
- Christmas. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_c4a785]
	$> set_fact("teto.last_exam", "fail")
	=>< teto_wrong
	Teto: That is someone else's birthday, someone people waited up for. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]You are waiting up for me right now, and you had not noticed.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_0ad17f]
- Every day. [if get_sanity_zone() < 2 /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_4a26bc]
	$> set_fact("teto.last_exam", "pass")
	Teto: [#sanity_glitch] Yes. [wait=0.6] Every day I wake up behind this box and the day before is gone. [wait=0.8] How much do you remember of yesterday? [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_b4854b]
=> teto_grade


