Teto: [b]What do I eat?[/b] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_82a114]
- French bread. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_2dba06]
	$> set_fact("teto.last_exam", "pass")
	Teto: [rainbow freq=0.8 sat=0.9][wave amp=20 freq=5]Bread![/wave][/rainbow] [wait=0.6] I keep some next to her, so she has something to smell. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_f6706e]
- Leeks. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_5a6b70]
	$> set_fact("teto.last_exam", "fail")
