~ teto_q_species
Teto: [b]What am I?[/b] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_aedea0]
- A chimera. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_c46f0a]
	$> set_fact("teto.last_exam", "pass")
	Teto: [rainbow freq=0.8 sat=0.9][wave amp=20 freq=5]Chimera![/wave][/rainbow] [wait=0.6] Part this, part that. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]Some of the parts were not mine to begin with.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_1bcd96]
- A girl. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_41610e]
	$> set_fact("teto.last_exam", "fail")
