=> teto_grade


~ teto_grade
if get_fact("teto.last_exam", "") == "pass"
	if get_fact("teto.exams_passed", 0) < 3
		$> set_fact("teto.exams_passed", get_fact("teto.exams_passed", 0) + 1)
		$> add_favor("teto", 1)
		## Pays at most 3 times.
		Teto: [font_size=30][b][rainbow sat=1][wave amp=25 freq=6]PASSED![/wave][/rainbow][/b][/font_size] [wait=0.8] I owe you {{get_favor("teto")}}. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]I always pay. Nobody ever asks me what with.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_9761a2]
	else
		Teto: Passed. [wait=0.6] Again. [wait=0.6] You know all the answers now. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]So why do you keep coming back to be asked?[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_212f37]
else
	Teto: [color=#a33][b]Failed.[/b][/color] [wait=0.8] [color=#7fffd4][wave amp=15 freq=4]It is fine![/wave][/color] [wait=0.6] Try again. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]I will not write this one down. I will just remember it.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_ae2a54]
=> teto_menu


~ teto_name
$> set_fact("teto.named")
$> add_sanity(10)
## opp 3 or more. Gives 10 sanity.
Teto: [speed=0.3]...[/speed] [wait=1.0] [rainbow freq=0.2 sat=0.5]Kasane Teto.[/rainbow] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_e671fc]
Teto: You said it slowly, like it was a real name. [wait=0.8] People usually laugh after. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_c6792d]
Teto: [speed=0.5]Fine.[/speed] [wait=1.0] I will let her out. [wait=1.0] [color=#777]Later. When I am sure that someone will still say mine.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_563bff]
=> teto_menu


~ teto_wrong
$> set_fact("teto.wrong", get_fact("teto.wrong", 0) + 1)
$> add_opinion("teto", -1)
$> add_sanity(-5)
match get_fact("teto.wrong", 0)
	when 1
		[[Teto|TETO|T E T O]]: [#jumpscare] [shake rate=40 level=25][font_size=40][b]WRONG.[/b][/font_size][/shake] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_dde23e]
		Teto: [color=#ff8fd0][wave amp=10 freq=4]Sorry! Sorry![/wave][/color] [wait=0.8] That was loud. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]I will do the next one closer to your ear.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_539c17]
	when 2
		[[Teto|TETO|T E T O]]: [#jumpscare] [shake rate=40 level=25][font_size=40][b]AGAIN.[/b][/font_size][/shake] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_dff81c]
		Teto: [color=#777]Two. [wait=0.6] Your hands are shaking. [wait=0.6] Hold them out, I want to count the fingers.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_492d5e]
	when 3
		[[Teto|TETO|T E T O]]: [#jumpscare] [#sanity_glitch] [font_size=40][b]Three.[/b][/font_size] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_4c4c81]
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] I wrote it on the inside of the bag. [wait=0.6] [color=#777]You will read it later, from the inside.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_b14755]
	when 4
		[[Teto|TETO|T E T O]]: [#jumpscare] [#sanity_glitch] [shake rate=50 level=30][font_size=48]FOUR[/font_size][/shake] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_7a992c]
		Teto: [#sanity_glitch] [speed=0.3]One more[/speed] [wait=1.0] and there will be room for two in here. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_26a3bc]
	else
		$> set_fact("teto.evicted")
		## Five wrong answers. Two bread brings TETO back.
		[[Teto|TETO|T E T O]]: [#jumpscare] [#sanity_glitch] [shake rate=60 level=40][font_size=56][b]ENOUGH.[/b][/font_size][/shake] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_9937be]
		Teto: [speed=0.2]...[/speed] [wait=1.0] We are leaving. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]When you get home, check behind your door before you lock it.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_4f2ba5]
		=> END!
=> END


~ teto_evicted
Behind box there are crumbs, a long drag mark and a note in your own handwriting. [i]"you know what you did. 2 baguettes."[/i] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_39559e]
- Leave two bread. [if has_item("bread", 2) /] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_df6d52]
	$> remove_item("bread", 2)
	$> set_fact("teto.evicted", false)
	$> set_fact("teto.wrong", 0)
	$> add_opinion("teto", 1)
	## TETO count starts over
	Teto: [rainbow sat=1][wave amp=25 freq=6]Welcome back![/wave][/rainbow] [wait=1.2] I was standing right behind you. [wait=0.8] [color=#777]You walked past me twice.[/color] [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_f63010]
	=> teto_hub
- Leave. [ID:baupjsuxjq75l_894465]
	=> END
